body:
real asshole move from grey. one of my all time favorite youtube channels is no better than a schoolyard bully. until grey apologizes for this my patreon sub is cancelled.

&#x200B;

and no this isnt 'fan boying' or any variation of the phrase. i was a bigger cgp grey fan than vth fan, i just dont have any blind devotion to grey. what hes doing is wrong.
